---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SDD_SEQ_01_Guest as Guest
  participant SDD_SEQ_01_UI as Registration UI
  participant SDD_SEQ_01_API as RegistrationController
  participant SDD_SEQ_01_Service as RegistrationService
  participant SDD_SEQ_01_DB as RegistrationStore /<br/>PostgreSQL
  participant SDD_SEQ_01_Ports as Secrets and delivery ports
  SDD_SEQ_01_Guest->>SDD_SEQ_01_UI: submit organization/account fields
  SDD_SEQ_01_UI->>SDD_SEQ_01_API: register command
  SDD_SEQ_01_API->>SDD_SEQ_01_Service: register(validated fields, password, address)
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service->>SDD_SEQ_01_Ports: require configuration, hash password
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service->>SDD_SEQ_01_DB: transaction, lock email, insert account/registration
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service->>SDD_SEQ_01_DB: queue proof delivery, audit
  SDD_SEQ_01_DB-->>SDD_SEQ_01_Service: committed registration
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_01_UI: resumable stage
  SDD_SEQ_01_Guest->>SDD_SEQ_01_UI: enter received email code
  SDD_SEQ_01_UI->>SDD_SEQ_01_API: verify email
  SDD_SEQ_01_API->>SDD_SEQ_01_Service: verifyEmail(actor, code, address)
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service->>SDD_SEQ_01_DB: lock proof and registration
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service->>SDD_SEQ_01_Ports: compare proof digest and validity
  alt valid unconsumed proof
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service->>SDD_SEQ_01_DB: consume proof, record verification
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_01_UI: MFA enrollment stage
  else invalid / expired / rate-limited
  SDD_SEQ_01_Service-->>SDD_SEQ_01_UI: explicit failure, stage unchanged
  end
